{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12398","headline":"裴仆射东亭 · 钱起","name":"裴仆射东亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤扆任匡济，云溪难退还。\n致君超列辟，得道在荣班。\n朱戟缭垣下，高斋芳树间。\n隔花开远水，废卷爱晴山。\n晚沐值清兴，知音同解颜。\n藉兰开赐酒，留客下重关。\n仙犬逐人静，朝车映竹闲。\n则知真隐逸，未必谢区寰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}